e room. Unlock doors, trigger mechanisms, and follow hidden clues to advance. Every puzzle solved reveals more of the manor’s story and brings you closer to finding your missing friend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person exploration with environmental puzzle-solving.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creepy, atmospheric manor with a story woven into every room.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inventory-based interactions to manipulate the world and unlock new rooms.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lore fragments and hidden notes that reveal the manor’s dark past.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slow-burn suspense that escalates as you uncover the truth.</p></li></ul>",
